#ASSERT `s 110(4) the person is barred from disablement benefit in respect of byssinosis` TRUE NOTHING FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 110(4) the person is barred from disablement benefit in respect of byssinosis` TRUE NOTHING TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 110(4) the person is barred from disablement benefit in respect of byssinosis` FALSE (JUST FALSE) FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 110(4) the person is barred from disablement benefit in respect of byssinosis` FALSE (JUST TRUE) TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
